We are running this model:

https://huggingface.co/intfloat/multilingual-e5-small

The model shipped here is designed for avx512, which out machines don't support.
Thankfully, it has also been distilled for avx2, here:

https://huggingface.co/deepfile/multilingual-e5-small-onnx-qint8

Both the model and tokenizer come from this repository.
